# Normalise to LF in the repo. This is a Windows dev machine deploying to Linux
# (Railway, Cloudflare, GitHub Actions) — CRLF leaking into shell scripts or
# Dockerfiles breaks them at runtime, not at commit time.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.webp binary
*.avif binary
*.ico binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.pdf binary
